  "details": "Having a single Animation trying to animate the \"Phys Bone.Limit Type\" to anything (even the used value) does seem to break the limits completely, almost like it gets set to \"none\".\n\nThis was working and roughly broke around early november 23. We initially suspected the \"multi child type: ignore\" to not properly function, but as it turns out, it seems to be that property within animations. You can even see and test it in play mode using the av3 emulator.\n\nHere is a video of the difference (first one has the property animated, second avatar not. Bone Structure & physbones are the same as are the animators)\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xRwdANtr4jo\n\nWould be amazing if this would get fixed :-)",
